  "applies_to": "Kohler MPAC 1000 ATS controllers, Modbus RTU on RS-485, per section 12 of TP-6113.",
  "summary": "The MPAC 1000 is a Kohler automatic transfer switch controller. Its Modbus RTU map reports source A and source B voltages and frequencies, contactor position and source availability, phase sequence, active time delay, I/O and accessory status, transfer statistics and write-only test and manual-action commands. This map covers the monitoring block, nominal ratings, status words, maintenance counters and the command register.",
